      "body": "## Summary\n\nImport `torch` at the TorchTitan package entry point, before submodules can import `spmd_types`. This is a deliberately small, backend-neutral initialization-order change: no explicit `torch_npu` import, device-specific branches, or swallowed initialization errors.\n\n## Why\n\nOn the tested NPU stack, `import torchtitan.components.loss` enters `spmd_types` before Torch finishes loading its device extensions. NPU backend initialization then imports symbols from the partially initialized SPMD module, causing a circular-import failure involving `register_local_autograd_function`. Initializing Torch first makes that same native import succeed.\n\nThis only addresses imports through TorchTitan, not arbitrary third-party code importing `spmd_types` first.\n\n## Validation and draft status\n\n- The native import above fails before and succeeds after the change on Torch 2.14.0 / TorchNPU 2.14.0+git9c3f664 / spmd_types 0.2.3.\n- `import torchtitan.models.base.module` succeeds both before and after.\n- Formatting, syntax, license, flake8, ufmt, pydoclint, codespell and link checks passed.\n- Full pre-commit was previously attempted: Pyrefly failed with dependency/API-resolution errors in the local Torch 2.11 environment, including missing main dependencies. The latest changed-file run also cannot locate Pyrefly on its default PATH. Full lint is **not** claimed passing.\n- **Important:** main pins a newer SPMD commit than the tested stack. Reproduce and verify using main's pinned dependencies before requesting review.\n- Native main RoPE test collection in the existing NPU environment is blocked by missing `torch_remat`. Full main NPU training, CUDA regression and CI are not claimed passing.\n- No v0.3.0 training results are presented as current-main validation.\n\n## Scope\n\nOne production file, three added lines. No custom test runners, environment patches, or v0.3.0-only adaptation changes are included. Main already covers some of those historical changes; the old RoPE workaround was also excluded after unmodified main methods passed direct NPU checks.\n\nPlease keep this PR as a draft pending validation with the matching main dependency stack.\n",
